---
// First-view intro: the stacked wordmark assembles in the middle of the screen
// ("fone" from the left, "check" from the right, the orange rule between them),
// then flies into the logo spot in the header while the cover fades away.
// Plays once per browser session, never with reduced motion, and a tap or key
// press skips it. Without JavaScript the cover never appears.
---
